id=wandr-stack
name=wandr Hybrid runtime stack
version=v0.1.0
versionCode=1
author=harry
description=Starts wandr-host --zygote + wandr-arbiter --daemon at boot (Hybrid runtime model, task 46). Reversible: touch /data/adb/modules/wandr-stack/disable to skip, or .../remove to uninstall on next reboot.
